# LINEAGE (Seat R 77th, 2026-11-03): copy of Seat R 76th's pushlock_r76_newbranch_v3.sh with the r76 tokens on matching lines changed to r77 by rekey_r77.py (a named-file pass, the diff read line by line, no logic line changed). Earlier seats' LINEAGE lines are left exactly as they were written.
